{"title":"2017 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Trial_and_Error)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Trial and Error)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is one pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e24c43456d95b5ab8d4f2f8f85a644e98b7ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> of positive integers for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/842f8c4a6c9ada51fbb2df1656864cc8f049a29d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + 3b = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />. What are the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Trial_and_Error.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Trial_and_Error)\">Solution 1 (Trial and Error)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Trial and Error)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use trial and error, as there aren't that many possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49c5626e8e4ea770014a1bfcb31b3d66e01e8fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 4 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, which goes above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6dda8115d8d4a649a1736b3797df21af5fbb54fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 3 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> doesn't.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/8/b28b641f6e6526f6b68284ffb1db4caa8ce7b651.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 1 + 3b = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/5/5f56d7b5a6c955b4b7bdc521cab60d98e06e0dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b + 5 = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/1/de1e5b3f5f4249d2bc90091eb44a2539f90c08cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b = 19 - 5 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf0953f43c76a5c79f339f9aee0fc2baac51413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e427ac2932d4e9776babc229180ffdc1a28760.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 2 + 3b = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b45fecd063a810292d68984f17ab019e9ec57c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a + 10 = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/a/e4aa363a32d5fb944d8adb38886c19fb9986e44f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a = 19 - 10 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd61971cee6d8ff06004459f5e07009879179511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{a = 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"56\" height=\"25\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/b/f5b3a8e64f4a61f60aed87f5c20db5d575cf1a80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{9}{3} = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We realize that the remainder of the left hand side must also be equal to the remainder of the right hand side when dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because they are equal. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/e/42e048a31f8e318b3a757cd501c9df65b1f3cf2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + 3b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" /> has the same remainder as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> because we can subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/7/6577c27b2db885fa652822390cb5b4e88e54004e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(a + b) = 3a + 3b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> has a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> must have a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> has a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>However, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49c5626e8e4ea770014a1bfcb31b3d66e01e8fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 4 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, which goes above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6dda8115d8d4a649a1736b3797df21af5fbb54fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 3 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> doesn't. Thus, the only way for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to have a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd61971cee6d8ff06004459f5e07009879179511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{a = 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"56\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf0953f43c76a5c79f339f9aee0fc2baac51413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/842f8c4a6c9ada51fbb2df1656864cc8f049a29d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + 3b = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e427ac2932d4e9776babc229180ffdc1a28760.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 2 + 3b = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/3/2b30739e5b3b817f51e8633c2fbcbec1aee32d21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b + 10 = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/6/886ea8c1cd5ce26ed009d17ac95968688e32d925.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b = 19 - 10 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/b/f5b3a8e64f4a61f60aed87f5c20db5d575cf1a80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{9}{3} = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 242/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10094/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.095      1 2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.095      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35971:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018003515 and revision id 279542. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}